Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.79,0:22:30.44,Shiina中,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.20,0:22:38.70,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}Enchanted by the smile like a spark
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.20,0:22:38.70,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}你的笑容如花火般一瞬闪耀 我沉醉其中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.85,0:22:34.77,Shiina日,,0,0,0,,はーい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:33.85,0:22:34.77,Shiina中,,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.39,0:22:40.45,Shiina日,,0,0,0,,おっ アリ!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.39,0:22:40.45,Shiina中,,0,0,0,,啊 亚里!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.70,0:22:43.00,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}寂しい 忘れちゃう夜だ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.70,0:22:43.00,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}在这寂寥无声 愿将万事相忘的夜里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.09,0:22:43.84,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,もう 夜ご飯食べちゃった?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.09,0:22:43.84,Ari中,40,0,0,0,,你们已经吃过晚饭了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.33,0:22:45.60,Mimi日,21,0,0,0,,これからだよ
Dialogue: 1,0:22:44.33,0:22:45.60,Mimi中,20,0,0,0,,正要去吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.51,0:22:48.24,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}くだらなく愛おしい
Dialogue: 1,0:22:45.51,0:22:48.24,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}听你诉说那些微不足道
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.77,0:22:47.82,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,よかった
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.77,0:22:47.82,Ari中,40,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:51.45,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}話を聞かせて
Dialogue: 1,0:22:48.24,0:22:51.45,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}却又无比珍贵的绵绵情话
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.82,0:22:55.90,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,あ…あの よかったら 一緒に食べない?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:50.82,0:22:55.90,Ari中,40,0,0,0,,那…那个 可以的话 我们一起吃吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.28,0:22:55.73,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}Dance with me 二人で
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.28,0:22:55.73,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}与我共舞吧 执子之手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.73,0:22:58.32,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}無限の闇を
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.73,0:22:58.32,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}穿过这永恒的黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.42,0:22:58.13,Shiina日,,0,0,0,,うん!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:57.42,0:22:58.13,Shiina中,,0,0,0,,嗯!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.32,0:23:04.17,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}重ねた 手のひら ぎゅっと結んで
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.32,0:23:04.17,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}我们将彼此的双手 紧紧相系
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.64,0:22:59.87,Shiina日,,0,0,0,,ミミも行くよね?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.64,0:22:59.87,Shiina中,,0,0,0,,美美也去吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.87,0:23:01.21,Mimi日,21,0,0,0,,もちろん!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:59.87,0:23:01.21,Mimi中,20,0,0,0,,当然了!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.01,0:23:05.05,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,シーナ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.01,0:23:05.05,Ari中,40,0,0,0,,席娜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.17,0:23:07.75,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}ぼやけた視界に
Dialogue: 1,0:23:04.17,0:23:07.75,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}在泪水模糊的视线里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.23,0:23:07.33,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,ありがとね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.23,0:23:07.33,Ari中,40,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.75,0:23:10.33,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}映ったものは
Dialogue: 1,0:23:07.75,0:23:10.33,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}倒映而出的景象
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.81,0:23:10.03,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,ミミちゃんもありがと
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.81,0:23:10.03,Ari中,40,0,0,0,,也谢谢美美
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.33,0:23:16.36,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}悲しい くらいに 美しいんだね
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.33,0:23:16.36,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}竟是这般 凄美而动人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.22,0:23:13.69,Mimi日,21,0,0,0,,ん? 何が?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:11.22,0:23:13.69,Mimi中,20,0,0,0,,嗯? 谢什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.26,0:23:18.33,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,さーて なんでしょう
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.26,0:23:18.33,Ari中,40,0,0,0,,谢什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.36,0:23:21.26,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}彼方明けゆく空
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.36,0:23:21.26,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}远方的天空 隐隐破晓
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.33,0:23:21.43,Mimi日,21,0,0,0,,ええ お 教えてよ!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.33,0:23:21.43,Mimi中,20,0,0,0,,欸 告 告诉我嘛!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:24.77,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}目を逸らすんだ
Dialogue: 1,0:23:21.26,0:23:24.77,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}闭上双眼吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:24.97,Ari日,41,0,0,0,,どうしようかなー
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.19,0:23:24.97,Ari中,40,0,0,0,,要不要告诉你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.97,0:23:25.82,Mimi日,21,0,0,0,,ええ!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.97,0:23:25.82,Mimi中,20,0,0,0,,欸!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.82,0:23:27.56,Shiina日,前漏,0,0,0,,2人とも待ってる
Dialogue: 1,0:23:25.82,0:23:27.56,Shiina中,前漏,0,0,0,,你们两个等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.56,0:23:29.92,Mimi日,21,0,0,0,,シーナ 早く――
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.56,0:23:29.92,Mimi中,20,0,0,0,,席娜 快点——
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.92,0:23:30.88,Shiina日,,0,0,0,,待って!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.92,0:23:30.88,Shiina中,,0,0,0,,等一下!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.22,0:23:36.98,ED日,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,20)}Stay in night
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.22,0:23:36.98,ED中,,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord1\blur4\3a50\fad(300,300)\pos(960,70)}就让这一夜 成为永远
